{%- set items = lines_text or o.products -%}
{%- if remedy == "replacement" -%}
I'm sorry {{ items }} from order {{ o.order_id }} {{ "arrived in that condition" if kind == "damaged" else "wasn't what you ordered" }}. We'd like to send you a replacement.{% if requested_remedy == "refund" %} As the item is in stock, our policy is to replace it rather than refund it.{% endif %}
{%- elif remedy == "refund" -%}
I'm sorry {{ items }} from order {{ o.order_id }} {{ "arrived in that condition" if kind == "damaged" else "wasn't what you ordered" }}. Since it's currently out of stock, we'd like to refund {{ amount }} to your original payment method.
{%- elif remedy == "request_photo" -%}
I'm sorry about the problem with {{ items }} from order {{ o.order_id }}. Could you please reply with a photo of it? We need one to arrange a replacement or refund for items above {{ photo_threshold }}.
{%- elif reason == "reported_late" -%}
Order {{ o.order_id }} was delivered on {{ o.delivered }}. Damaged or wrong items need to be reported within {{ policy.damage.report_window_days }} days of delivery, so under our policy we can't offer a replacement or refund for this one. I'm sorry for the disappointment.
{%- elif reason == "items_unclear" -%}
I'm sorry about the problem with your order {{ o.order_id }}. Could you tell us which item is affected (and add a photo if you can)? Then we can arrange the right replacement or refund.
{%- elif reason == "not_delivered" -%}
Order {{ o.order_id }} hasn't been delivered yet. A colleague will look into this with you.
{%- endif -%}
